+## Pagination performance
+
+The reader seeks page candidates through the ranking indexes and ranks at most
+`limit + 1` rows. Exact global ranks still count preceding visible rows under RLS,
+including ties; deep pages are not constant-time. Admin generation invalidation
+and deterministic ordering remain unchanged. See the [measurements and indexes](https://github.com/RetroBreeze/supagame/blob/main/docs/guides/leaderboard-performance.md)
+for scaling limits and index storage/write tradeoffs.
