+
+## Cloud Saves generation protocol (module 0.1.5)
+
+Apply the additive migrations and matching Edge/SDK assets together. Existing live
+saves and five-revision recovery history survive. Old generationless writers fail
+closed; retain offline payloads and explicitly reconcile before creating new
+operations. Prepared legacy uploads cannot commit without generation context;
+abort/collect them and explicitly prepare again. Replay is finite: the latest
+3,072 completed operations that are also less than 30 days old. See [Cloud Saves](Cloud-Saves).
